  "description": "To demolish an existing single storey rear bathroom extension (built in the1970s). To propose a new single storey, full width, kitchen / dining room extension in brick, to match existing, with soldier course parapet wall, 3 ply grey flat roof and two skylights. Incorporating a new painted timber french door and a new painted timber sash window with additional timber back door, all designed to replicate the existing windows in the original rear brick house elevation. To propose replacing the front garden wall, currently in 1980s style open leaf block, and replace with a Bedford Park style low red brick wall with white painted timber fence, white painted timber front gate and a 2m high metal arch over the gateway.",
